# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party guidance, standards and reports are never committed.
#
# Copyrighted PDFs are not redistributed here. 04.references/README.md records
# provenance and retrieval for each. The markdown conversions under standards/
# are excluded too, because they are the text of copyrighted guidance and
# converting a format does not change that.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
04.references/reports/
04.references/standards/
04.references/ipcc-guidelines/
04.references/literature/

# macOS resource forks. The drive is exFAT, so macOS writes a ._ twin beside
# every file it touches.
._*
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd

# R and RStudio
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw input data is never committed.
#
# Large third-party data lives on the external drive and git carries only a
# manifest of provenance plus the small derived CSVs the book reads. GitHub
# rejects any file over 100 MB, so an accidental `git add 02.inputs` would
# wedge the repo. Everything under 02.inputs is ignored by default, and the
# exceptions below re-admit the documentation and the derived outputs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
02.inputs/**
!02.inputs/
!02.inputs/**/
!02.inputs/**/*.md
!02.inputs/derived/**

# The derived/** re-admission above would otherwise let macOS resource forks
# back in, so they are excluded again last and the ._* rule wins.
02.inputs/**/._*
**/._*

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Quarto. The book renders into 01.manuscript/_book, which is regenerable. The
# Word render is re-admitted because Word is the format that is read and sent.
01.manuscript/.quarto/
01.manuscript/_freeze/
01.manuscript/_book/*
!01.manuscript/_book/*.docx
01.manuscript/*_files/
01.manuscript/*_cache/
01.manuscript/*.html
01.manuscript/site_libs/

# Working files and communication. Nothing here is an input or an output.
/05.tasks/
/tasks/
/docs/
/attachments/
CLAUDE.md
INDEX.md

# Claude Code local state, except the shared project memory store
**/.claude/*
!**/.claude/memory/
.claudeprism/
